      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MODS (6) is the one to beat after back-to-back BM58 wins at this track, the latest as a well-supported favourite when he beat Charlie Magic by a length. He rises to BM64 grade, but Billy Cray has won two from two on him and his track record puts him on top. BAROCCO BAR (1) is the main threat off a sound second behind Biden Time over 1600m and a previous BM70 fourth behind Fury, with his broader 1300m record strong enough to offset the drop back in trip. SASS (8) brings honest recent form, having won a BM58 by just over three lengths before running third behind Biden Time, and her season profile keeps her right in calculations. MR MARRAKECH (3) has been runner-up at his past three, was sent out favourite when just beaten by KING AKEED, and has never missed a place in four runs at this track and distance. Include. KING AKEED (1) won narrowly by 0.8 lengths two runs back at this track and goes up in weight. Expected to be in the finish.",
